OL,5,G1900 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith a surge in criminals using
OL,7,     Ffake car number plates to commit
OL,8,     Fcrimes, Traffic Cops are under
OL,9,     Fpressure to locate these cloned
OL,10,     Fcars and catch criminals trying to
OL,11,     Ffly under the radar.
OL,12,G2000 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,13,G     Speeders
OL,14,     FA driver is shocked to hear the
OL,15,     Fcar he's driving is nicked as he's
OL,16,     Fleasing it from a friend. And cops
OL,17,     Fstop the driver of a car suspected
OL,18,     Fto be running drugs.
