OL,12,G0035 Cops
OL,13,     FA seasoned corporal gives some
OL,14,     Fadvice to a young man with a new
OL,15,     Fmotorcycle. A woman's impatience
OL,16,     Flands her in hot water when she's
OL,17,     Fpulled over for tailgating.
OL,18,G0100 Must Have Ideas
OL,19,     FWe search the world to bring you
OL,20,     Fthe most innovative home and
OL,21,     Fgarden must haves. So, sit back,
OL,22,     Frelax and discover something new.
