OL,10,     Ffrom a bit of bedroom spanking!
OL,11,G0345 Warship: Life in the Royal Navy
OL,12,     FJJ Chalmers joins recruits
OL,13,     Fpreparing for the realities of
OL,14,     Fwar, including chemical attack.
OL,15,     FAnd a new helicopter pilot lands
OL,16,     Fon the deck of a moving warship
OL,17,     Ffor the first time.
OL,18,G0435 Cruising with Susan Calman
OL,19,     FSusan sets sail on a cruise to the
OL,20,     Fsunny Canary Islands aboard the
OL,21,     FRegal Princess. First stop is the
OL,22,     Fisland of Gran Canaria.
